 r←ShowLastVersionInIndex(space folder args);project
⍝ Desc: Returns the last version of an APL object or a file in the index
⍝ Parse: 1 -project=
⍝ Project: 0
 project←folder
 :If 0<≢space                       ⍝ Only a project space can qualify a relative APL name
     project←⍕space
 :EndIf
 r←project ##.ShowLastVersionInIndex args._1
⍝Done
